#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0106 expect=violation domain=DM
#note "The AUTHOR-TOLERANT absent-column disposition: the STRAIN column is NOT DECLARED at all, and evalVariableIsNull returns TRUE for an absent column by explicit Python parity ('absent column => null'). CDISC-SEND-0105/0106 reach the column through an operation rather than a bare leaf and carry no Requirements.Variables gate, so an absent STRAIN neither skips the rule nor suppresses it -- which is precisely the contrast that motivated M3-D6 on the .1 successors, where a bare `empty(STRAIN)` leaf plus a Requirements.Variables entry made the same case unreachable. Pin the ROW ONLY: Output_Variables is [STRAIN] and its projected value is blank here. *** version=3-0 is LOAD-BEARING. M3-D8 restricted this rule's Standards block to the single (SENDIG, 3.0) entry the sheet supports -- row 526 is SEND106's ONLY row -- so from v3.1 onward only the .1 successor ships. Before that fix the base co-shipped with its replacement in five packages and CONTRADICTED it: a conformant v3.1+ study declaring the strain in TX was silent under 0106.1 and reported by 0106, which has no TX operand at all. ***"
#library standard=sendig version=3-0
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SUBJID  type=Char label="Subject Identifier for the Study"
col SPECIES type=Char label="Species"
col SEX     type=Char label="Sex"
col ARMCD   type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
col ARM     type=Char label="Description of Planned Arm"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | 001 | RAT | M | LD | Low Dose
S1 | DM | 002 | 002 | RAT | M | MD | Mid Dose
S1 | DM | 003 | 003 | RAT | F | HD | High Dose
---

dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | TS | 1 | TITLE   | Trial Title | 28-Day Oral Toxicity Study
S1 | TS | 2 | SPECIES | Species     | RAT
---
